Corresponding source of the giles-channel-whatsapp binary (AGPL section 6)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

- Giles, including this plugin, the build files, and Cargo.lock:
  https://github.com/jennings/giles
  at the commit named in the image's `org.opencontainers.image.revision` label (the image tag
